{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Among the Waves\u00a0</strong>is a philosophical Metroidvania with elements of an immersive sim, where pregnancy becomes a source of power and physics is your main weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world inspired by Russian culture and religious aesthetics, you explore <strong>Alatyr-M</strong> \u2014 a colossal techno-fortress where science intertwines with faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, solve puzzles, and bend gravity using the powers of the child growing inside the heroine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/f49455b98d8d21bc0777e5c3c0badc14.avif?t=1764785484\" width=1000 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alatyr-M</strong> is a black <strong>matryoshka fortress</strong>, hiding layers of Russian culture and scientific mysticism. Here, prayers blend with code, and an artificial intelligence learns to believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nameless</strong> is a wanderer who arrived at the fortress from afar \u2014 perhaps even from the depths of time. She carries a unique, divine <strong>Child</strong> that grants her superhuman abilities and protection. Together with her, the player will roam the endless corridors of the black fortress to unravel the mystery of the <strong>Doors of Birth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/f98a7081ae50438116e89f95602cfaf2.avif?t=1764785484\" width=686 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Combat:</strong> use the heroine\u2019s and her Child\u2019s abilities to teleport, unleash shockwaves, and open new paths while experimenting with world physics and the heroine\u2019s weight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8eb95b045baa424e75e81dbca81f91a4.poster.avif?t=1764785484\" width=558 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8eb95b045baa424e75e81dbca81f91a4.webm?t=1764785484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8eb95b045baa424e75e81dbca81f91a4.mp4?t=1764785484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character evolution &amp; new abilities:</strong> awaken the power of the <strong>Child</strong> and unlock the Nameless\u2019s full toolkit. Mix and match skills to suit your rhythm and playstyle as you face unique enemies and bosses guarding the depths of <strong>Alatyr-M</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8c54b6f75b808dde76b009d7b44c29e2.poster.avif?t=1764785484\" width=558 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8c54b6f75b808dde76b009d7b44c29e2.webm?t=1764785484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/8c54b6f75b808dde76b009d7b44c29e2.mp4?t=1764785484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unmistakable atmosphere:</strong> questions of being, faith, and religion stand alongside cynical <strong>Dromite</strong> raiders, robots, and intricate mechanisms brought to life beneath the vaults of an ancient fortress \u2014 all in a striking <strong>2.5D</strong> style that at times shifts into full <strong>3D</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/4f1ef2c2e37d135a425a11fca211ae2c.poster.avif?t=1764785484\" width=558 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/4f1ef2c2e37d135a425a11fca211ae2c.webm?t=1764785484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/4f1ef2c2e37d135a425a11fca211ae2c.mp4?t=1764785484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love atmospheric, demanding adventures; sci-fi worlds with a philosophical core; and compelling stories about claiming one\u2019s destiny \u2014 act now and <strong>add</strong> <strong>&quot;Among the Waves&quot; to your wishlist</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347690?t=1764785484","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/311ca010557ff2aa3db7dbb42f43af5f23e9c14e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764785484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/d33b85a5277563e97b503a30596623832c06164f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764785484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/d33b85a5277563e97b503a30596623832c06164f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764785484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conten